  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5919.01 Collaboration between Medical Director and Head of Unit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5919.01 Collaboration between Medical Director and Head of Unit. The head of unit and medical director shall collaborate with one another in regards to the following:\n\n(a) Education;\n\n(b) Advice;\n\n(c) Critiques;\n\n(d) Medications; and\n\n(e) Treatment modalities and performance improvement.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
